Hand-written revert of the heartbeat half of ef6622c1 against the current tree: the 30 s heartbeat
row in Plain is "• <name>  — <elapsed>" again, without the Task's latest count and Doing text, so a
log reader who gets no durable line per Doing call (ef6622c1) never sees the current item either.
The pinned tests fail on their heartbeat assertions by output, not by compilation. The other half of
the commit (no line per call) moved to milestone.go in fb0a15a2, which ef6622c1 did not change.

